  "description": "A lightweight .NET library for internal JWT authentication and claims handling, with refresh token rotation, password hashing, TOTP primitives, WebAuthn/FIDO2 second-factor verification, query-string tokens for WebSocket connections and path-scoped cookie tokens for files opened in a new tab",
