  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "With QueryStringTokenPaths or CookieTokenPaths set, a JwtBearerEvents handler set in a PostConfigure registered after AddEasyReasyAuth now runs, after the handlers set in Configure, unless those already decided the outcome. A later PostConfigure that replaces JwtBearerOptions.Events or sets EventsType, and so drops the token fallback, now fails at startup with an OptionsValidationException instead of silently. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy/blob/auth-v5.13.1/EasyReasy.Auth/README.md#migration-from-5130",
